     "text": "A thunderous chant shakes the dust from the ceiling. Above you, the whole Colosseum is shouting your name."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Overseer Vex",
     "text": "Rank 2 behind you, and the crowd wants you free. They bought your collar with their cheering. Don't look so surprised."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Overseer Vex",
     "text": "The Colosseum doesn't keep a champion in a cage. The stairs are open. Go on, before I change my mind."
    },
