     "who": "Overseer Vex",
     "text": "On your feet, islander. That portal dropped a fresh one into my pit."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Overseer Vex",
     "text": "You belong to the Colosseum now. You fight when I say, you bleed when they cheer."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Overseer Vex",
